Z||000000||88formula||01-07-2000||06:11 PM||||How high do you have to lift an 88 v6 fiero off the ground to get the engine and cradle assembly out from underneath it? What are some methods that you guy’s have used to do this with no lift? ||||reg||5
Z||000001||SCCA FIERO||01-07-2000||08:45 PM||||I think you need to lift it about 46 inches. ||||reg||1
Z||000002||fiero56||01-07-2000||09:26 PM||||v-8 archie has good points and instructions on pulling the engine/cradle.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.v8archie.com/arch8.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.v8archie.com/arch8.htm</A> <p>[This message has been edited by fiero56 (edited 01-08-2000).]||||reg||1
